### 1. Root Dashboard & Health Check
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/

### 2. System Health Status
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/health

### 3. Recommendation Models Analytics
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/recommend/analytics

### 4. Searchable Symptom List
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/symptoms

### 5. Content-Based Recommendation (TF-IDF + Cosine Similarity)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/recommend/items/0?num=3

### 6. Knowledge Graph Connections
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/recommend/graph/Panic disorder

### 7. Disease Prediction from Patient Vitals (Age, BP, Glucose, HR)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/predict/vitals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 45,
  "blood_pressure": 130,
  "glucose_level": 110,
  "heart_rate": 78
}

### 8. Medicine & Treatment Recommendation
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/recommend/medicine
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "diagnosis": "Panic disorder"
}

### 9. Hybrid Recommendation (Content-Based + SVD)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/recommend/hybrid
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "item_id": 0
}

### 10. NLP Review Feedback Sentiment Analysis
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/recommend/nlp-feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "The prescribed medication was very effective and relieved my symptoms well!"
}

### 11. Reinforcement Learning Bandit Reward Feedback
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/recommend/rl-feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "arm": 1,
  "reward": 1.0
}
